+  Tests: `npc-reports.test.mjs` (4), additions to `npc-action-icons`, `npc-needs-debug`,
+  `test-bridge-access`, `playtest-verify-run-access`.
+- Last full Rails run (after A-3): 1340 runs, 0 failures, 1 skip. Node: every `npc-*`,
